# These are raw firmware images for wireless NICs, not ELF executables.
# Some of them merely begin with ELF-like headers, which trips lintian's
# binary detection (same overrides Debian's own firmware packages carry).
# Patterns are package-wide: every file in this package is firmware.
arch-independent-package-contains-binary-or-object
statically-linked-binary
unstripped-binary-or-object
